We were having a party.

00:07:53.606 --> 00:07:55.474
I wanna say
it was Thanksgiving

00:07:55.474 --> 00:07:57.442
-Oh, no.
-or Winnie --

00:07:57.442 --> 00:07:58.744
Frannie's birthday
