00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.137
[ Laughing ]

00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:26.806
[ Laughter ]

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:28.874
-Tangled into the walker.
-Tangled into the walker

00:08:28.874 --> 00:08:31.877
and just started doing spinouts.
-And my dad is yelling,

00:08:31.877 --> 00:08:33.779
"[muttering]"

