and then everyone, of course,

00:08:35.013 --> 00:08:37.215
-Trying to hold the dad.
-all the women around dad,

00:08:37.215 --> 00:08:38.317
trying to hold him, are all
-The dog is

00:08:38.317 --> 00:08:39.485
-yelling and screaming.
-squealing

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:41.687
and everyone's --
-Gary made sounds,

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:43.688
for the first time,
she usually doesn't

00:08:43.688 --> 00:08:44.723
and blah, blah, blah.

00:08:44.723 --> 00:08:45.824
-That was a Gary memory.

00:08:45.824 --> 00:08:47.460
-Hi!
-Hello.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.128
-Hey, guys.
-How you guys doin'?

00:08:49.128 --> 00:08:50.162
