to be there.

00:09:45.684 --> 00:09:48.220
I was sort of like meeting her
to go somewhere or something.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:52.291
Anyway, so, but then,
on the set,

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:55.560
we were on location
and that really creates

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:58.530
this like camp feel
for everybody and --

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.665
-Hello.
-Hi.

00:09:59.665 --> 00:10:04.570
-Hey.
-And he was just

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:07.973
so friendly and fun!

00:10:07.973 --> 00:10:09.842
